            "review_title": "Review at Ocean House",
            "review_text": "Rob M\nDai Lanh, Vietnam4 contributions\n0\nFine food and Coffees, Waterfront. Fresh local Lamb,mushrooms. I highly reccomend.\nJul 2020\nThe location is on the waterfront, the Ocean House is set on a bay overlooking the busy shipping lanes to the Saigon river. Just outside the centre of Vung Tau an area formerly known as Strawberry Bay.\n\nThe atmosphere, seaside, open, nice background music, on the water, smell coffees and good cooking when you step in.\n\nGreat Coffees, the best spot for a sunset dinner; roast local leg of lamb dinner or eggs benedict breakfast. I found the Coast House, had the roast lamb and had to return for the eggs benedict. Nice spot. A Great Find in Vung Tau. Enjoy.\n\nGreat Cafe, coffees, breakfast, dining, licensed.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten August 9, 2020",
